:"dongyuan-e-p102a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-3f85f372dee0e4571dcb","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《三辅决录注》曰：“日!字翁叔，马融之族子。少传融业，以才学进。与杨彪、卢植、蔡邕等，典校中书。历位九卿，遂登台辅。”","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-661ec5fbaea14f20dcb2","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p015","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-87f3878f95852484824d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《献帝纪》曰：“卓谋废帝，会群臣于朝堂，议曰：‘大者天地，次者君臣，所以为治。今皇帝暗弱，不可以奉宗庙，为天下主。欲依伊尹、霍光故事，立陈留王，何如？’尚书卢植曰：‘按《尚书》，太甲既立，不明；伊尹放之桐宫。昌邑王立二十七日，罪过千余；故霍光废之。今上富于春秋，行未有失，非前事之比也。’卓怒，罢坐，欲诛植。侍中蔡邕劝之，得免。九月，甲戌，卓复大会群臣曰：‘太后逼迫永乐太后，令以忧死；逆妇姑之礼，无孝顺之节。天子幼质，软弱不君。昔伊尹放太甲，霍光废昌邑；著在典籍，佥以为善。今太后宜如太甲，皇帝宜如昌邑；陈留王仁孝，宜即尊皇祚。’”","attribution":"《献帝纪》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-04146f894cef8a06feb3","start":0,"end":270,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p102","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-3f85f372dee0e4571dcb","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《三辅决录注》曰：“日!字翁叔，马融之族子。少传融业，以才学进。与杨彪、卢植、蔡邕等，典校中书。历位九卿，遂登台辅。”","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-661ec5fbaea14f20dcb2","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-de24837e5b2f23ea1ad0","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-afe1da28250a86830af7","layer":"original","quote":"侯太守器之〖4〗，以女妻焉。﹝二﹞遣诣涿郡卢植读经","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-355528fdf33c48061ad5","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖北征柳城，过涿郡，令告太守曰：‘故北中郎将卢植，名著海内，学为儒宗，士之楷模，乃国之桢干也。昔武王入殷，封商容之闾；郑丧子产，而仲尼陨涕。孤到此州，嘉其余风。《春秋》之义，贤者之后，有异于人。敬遣丞、掾修坟墓，并致薄醊，以彰厥德","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":209,"end":325,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-930199e0618811bfc7a8","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"植字子幹。少事马融，与郑玄同门相友。植刚毅有大节，常喟然有济世之志；不苟合取容，不应州、郡命召。建宁中，征博士，出补九江太守。以病去官。作《尚书章句》、《礼记解诂》。稍迁侍中、尚书","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":11,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-c275ea9b9b51e2f6fc28","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"张角起，以植为北中郎将，征角失利，抵罪。顷之，复以为尚书","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":102,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-d2eced30e3ce2f620858","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"植以老病去位，隐居上谷军都山，初平三年卒","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":188,"end":208,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-f0a6bd6f38ec4ff35d9d","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"张让劫少帝奔小平津，植手剑责数让等；让等皆放兵，垂泣谢罪，遂自杀","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":131,"end":163,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-fafc808d973caba1f0c4","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-48e787a6e4eb4ba5954c","layer":"pei","quote":"董卓议欲废帝，众莫敢对，植独正言","attribution":"裴注·《续汉书》","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":540,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b9684c80febfb192f5b","start":164,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7e98ab0f04859dab4e1e","layer":"original","quote":"年十五，母使行学〖8〗；与同宗刘德然、辽西公孙瓒，俱事故九江太守同郡卢植。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o003","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7e98ab0f04859dab4e1e","layer":"original","quote":"年十五，母使行学〖8〗；与同宗刘德然、辽西公孙瓒，俱事故九江太守同郡卢植。德然父元起常资给先主，与德然等〖9〗。元起妻曰：“各自一家，何能常尔邪〖10〗！” 〔元〕 起曰：“吾宗中有此儿，非常人也。”而瓒深与先主相友；瓒年长，先主以兄事之。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
